title: Authorizations › New case › The stepper and the five steps
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId
intro: The strip at the top of New case: Intake, Eligibility & Benefits, Clinical documentation, Authorization preparation, Review & submit. Every step opens at any time, forward or back; the draft keeps what was typed and what the agents did. Each step shows one state under its name, and the same state sits in the step's own header.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A case is open on any step"
screen sc1 "Stepper under the title and the 'Authorization type' dropdown\nFive steps, each a button with its name and one state label under it"
process p1 "The current step: dark circle with its number\nComplete: a tick. Needs attention: a warning triangle. Blocked: a cross\nNot applicable: a dashed circle with a dash. Pending: the step number"
decision d1 "Which step did the person click?"
click c1 "Click any step, including a later one"
process p2 "The draft's position moves to that step\nNothing typed and nothing the agents did is lost"
screen sc2 "Page shows that step\nSentence under the title and the step header change with it"
screen sH "Step header\n'STEP 2 OF 5' · step name · state pill · one reason, e.g. 'Coverage and benefits checked'"
process pTip "Hover a step: its one-line reason\n'Needs the payer, member ID and dates', '2 warnings', 'The draft is ready'"
process pNoStart "Opening Authorization preparation never starts the agents\nIt says 'The agents have not started' with one button, 'Start the agents'"

group gSub "The sentence under the title"
  screen t1 "Intake: the type's own line\nInitial: 'Start with a referral or a patient. Everything is editable.'\nReview, renewal, modification: 'Find the patient, then the authorization ...'\nRetroactive: 'Care was delivered before an authorization was in place. Say what, when and why.'"
  screen t2 "Eligibility & Benefits: 'Verify checks coverage and benefits for the dates asked. A warning says what to do next and never traps you.'"
  screen t3 "Clinical documentation: 'Drop what you have. Reader sorts the files and lists what is still missing. The required items come from the payer's saved list.'\nTop right: 'Use sample chart'"
  screen t4 "Authorization preparation: 'The agents are reading the chart and checking Summit's rules. Questions come to you only when they must.'"
  screen t5 "Review & submit: 'Nothing is sent to the payer until a person signs. See what is missing first, then read the summary.'"
endgroup

group gFwd "Each step's own buttons"
  click b1 "Intake: 'Save as draft', 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits'"
  click b2 "Eligibility & Benefits: 'Back', 'Save as draft', 'Continue to Clinical documentation'"
  click b3 "Clinical documentation: 'Back', 'Save as draft', 'Continue'"
  click b4 "Authorization preparation: 'Back', 'Pause all agents', 'Skip ahead', 'Review & submit'"
  click b5 "Review & submit: 'Back', 'Save as draft'\nThe button that signs is in the Sign card on the right"
endgroup
process pBack "'Back' goes one step back\nIn the step bar at the bottom, always in view while a long step scrolls"
process pHint "The footer's hint line says what is still open, never that the person cannot go on\ne.g. 'Still to add: patient, payer. You can go on; Review & submit lists what is missing.'"

click cLink "Click the link 'Case Manager' above the title"
goto gCm "Continues in: Case Manager"
screen sFull "Stepper on the full referral page\n'Intake' is current\nThe button 'Back to the case' sits beside the crumbs"
goto gFull "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Referral › The full referral page"
goto gStates "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Step states"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Initial authorization"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Authorization preparation › Start the run and watch it"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Review & submit › The draft and the summary"

s1 --> sc1 --> p1 --> d1
sc1 --> pTip
d1 --> c1 --> p2 --> sc2 --> sH
sc2 -.-> pNoStart
sc2 --> t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 & t5
t1 --> b1 --> g1
t2 --> b2 --> g2
t3 --> b3 --> g3
t4 --> b4 --> g4
t5 --> b5 --> g5
b2 --> pBack
b3 --> pBack
b4 --> pBack
b5 --> pBack
b1 -.-> pHint
b2 -.-> pHint
b3 -.-> pHint
sH -.-> gStates
sc1 --> cLink --> gCm
sc1 -.-> sFull --> gFull
